29:58.027506','2025-10-07 13:29:58.027506','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.WAN Manager should be enabled\n4.DSL Line Should be Enabled ','21c4e4ba-84a7-48b7-9c97-a887bac8f50d'),('1077eb75-d7ad-4c0e-a8d2-1f83f8477d36','2026-07-30 05:14:45.470595','2026-07-30 05:14:45.470596','Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT','a43cf96a-bd03-4dc0-80c4-d67f589b6f98'),('1087ebd8-c90b-49f1-8907-35fac6ef7cb7','2025-10-07 13:45:16.923551','2025-10-07 13:45:16.923551','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','898c1634-a69c-4c3b-8449-f8f94fc320b7'),('108b0392-52af-41d3-86de-cb493382bebb','2026-06-16 10:44:04.432400','2026-06-16 10:44:04.432402','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Appsrc_Video_Underflow_Playback_VP9 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_webm_4k_vp9 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames','4fe73e40-9be0-4c81-8262-29231e2cc60b'),('108b3f17-2ffd-4051-87b1-b2bc681ba591','2025-11-03 10:03:33.537027','2025-11-03 10:03:33.537028','Lightning Shaka Player app should be hosted','d28613e2-0e0e-40ef-a6cb-59ca8a8533a3'),('10989994-7664-4a58-9fd6-67b00c1cd73c','2026-06-16 10:44:12.732472','2026-06-16 10:44:12.732473','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Only Audio OPUS stream should be updated in the config variable audio_src_url_short_duration_webm_opus inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_EOS_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait for receiving EOS','ce8ea8a2-bf1e-48a7-b068-c40817d49654'),('10999d3a-fa79-48fd-8e93-288d8ca31658','2025-10-07 13:27:59.054084','2025-10-07 13:27:59.054084','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3. Make sure LAN client is connected before running the script','476562be-2784-4694-ad75-5f9b66072555'),('109bed26-77eb-4115-8145-0fab4bc0ac27','2025-12-03 02:35:14.566584','2025-12-03 02:35:14.566584','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','05fa93ab-2593-4d33-b52d-1fd43642f500'),('109e8a9b-e517-4fda-a89a-d7b0c9d068ab','2025-10-07 13:24:53.930282','2025-10-07 13:24:53.930282','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3. A lan client should be connected','8fd076bf-a50d-402d-ace8-40f3c93af6f1'),('10a30412-fcb0-4465-9509-31077bbf8cc3','2026-08-05 11:44:38.148594','2026-08-05 11:44:38.148596','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.\n3. Cellular manager should be UP and status should be CONNECTED.','858e5dfc-41e1-400f-89c1-3567d7f1bc97'),('10a440c5-e339-4878-af89-b966a36bbfa2','2025-10-07 13:16:52.561593','2025-10-07 13:16:52.561593','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','b2831fa8-cd5c-493b-b197-00d487616cef'),('10a9