-10-07 13:10:25.545981','1. Initialize the MFR module using mfr_init()','82a8104b-f7c4-47a6-8443-78d944b16843'),('2a1dbd26-484a-420d-ad4b-3efe61b75dae','2025-10-07 13:34:16.066510','2025-10-07 13:34:16.066510','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','3d2025bb-82a6-437d-8798-0828e7c8496f'),('2a237bd2-3a7d-4c2d-99ed-8716db7e87f4','2025-10-07 13:28:37.209715','2025-10-07 13:28:37.209715','TDK test agent should be running\nPAM module\'s parameter xml should be available','12e1666e-0b2f-4ba2-b6cd-49e8cae0bfd5'),('2a29f03d-4112-40f6-88d0-8ccd44934a48','2025-10-07 13:27:00.994865','2025-10-07 13:27:00.994865','1. Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2. TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','da1512c0-63cb-4049-a8b4-ee8ba46aa951'),('2a2b285b-458f-40c0-8c4e-859434af561c','2025-10-07 13:33:12.928762','2025-10-07 13:33:12.928762','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','0d1ab98a-804e-485c-a861-d4c4a110c28e'),('2a2c953e-070d-4cea-a3e3-323aa53e5755','2025-10-07 13:31:42.740566','2025-10-07 13:31:42.740566','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','10f36a32-08af-43cc-abf5-c9696df05c0c'),('2a2cc062-ac43-4a8e-88da-83e2f794c91b','2025-10-07 13:26:21.295039','2025-10-07 13:26:21.295039','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','75d04da1-7fb0-4325-9876-ceaf6a1410ee'),('2a303933-ea71-428e-b33e-4b9