9.276082','2025-10-07 13:20:39.276082','1. wpeframework should be up and running','97c13d19-06ff-45e0-b72d-d87e5a38d495'),('2a6ca872-440f-4e4a-88d2-eaf67d446c6d','2025-10-07 13:17:33.328579','2025-10-07 13:17:33.328579','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','e2f8426d-7045-416f-a546-df3b3228a09c'),('2a6d0f8c-9dc3-43a7-aee4-cce6af519967','2025-10-07 13:45:43.930210','2025-10-07 13:45:43.930210','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','10b50351-d5ac-4619-82c2-549cfccaaf27'),('2a6e2ebe-11c6-4aa1-a12e-c5ab1a2ed301','2025-10-07 13:28:41.227267','2025-10-07 13:28:41.227267','TDK test agent should be running\nMOCA module\'s parameter xml should be available','8a5fec31-5f4c-4dfd-95f3-985dd03e0a56'),('2a800ba7-f801-4cb9-9d17-e1c3002289b1','2025-10-07 13:36:15.696515','2025-10-07 13:36:15.696515','Set proper values in tdk_platform.properties file and xconfVariables.py','00ce5564-d50f-49d9-a5cb-c0dd0f23870d'),('2a837aa8-7fcd-48cf-9cc0-6bd99fce08bb','2026-06-16 10:44:03.033142','2026-06-16 10:44:03.033143','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an MP4 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_mp4 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config fil