 13:29:47.220911','2025-10-07 13:29:47.220911','.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.WAN Manager should be enabled\n4.Both DSL WAN and WANOE WAN connections should be available\n5.If DUT_Mode_Fixed_Mode is set to 1 set the policy to FIXED_MODE and run the script','0c6c326c-63a1-4aa3-9cc5-8fbf590d3bfc'),('2acc3fdc-f8e5-4b40-8fac-208cd16d92f8','2025-10-07 13:26:33.060115','2025-10-07 13:26:33.060711','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','edc76a2e-f932-4c16-a072-e26289f05dcf'),('2acfad09-12c9-4fc6-a52f-b300717b9d71','2025-10-07 13:35:22.759865','2025-10-07 13:35:22.759865','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it Through StartTdk.sh script','f7255ff3-8021-4209-85c2-930ed734af67'),('2ad1199b-3748-4c39-af52-ddd1caec9995','2025-11-03 11:08:25.051396','2025-11-03 11:08:25.051403','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem','ce9625ca-16c1-4990-84ab-933d79730f57'),('2ad14e8e-ebf9-467b-b6ec-4e3641fea87c','2025-10-07 13:17:58.216316','2025-10-07 13:17:58.216316','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','a4c486fa-2e4b-4772-ad44-a537bad9597f'),('2ae29931-76f1-42bd-a1de-e05879704003','2026-06-26 09:55:49.465193','2026-06-26 09:55:49.465228','AppManager plugin should be present on the device','79c48f6f-ad61-4e89-a7bf-bfee8917f6be'),('2aef11c0-b6e9-494e-a977-44deea71cdb7','2025-10-07 13:13:19.465191','2025-10-07 13:13:19.465191','The device must be on