27','Download the app package when it is not already available â€” If the app is not installed, download the package via org.rdk.DownloadManager.1.download.','80eb029c-9f70-4dd7-a616-6a5ef9b31686'),('57c6fb87-2538-41a5-94c9-be7064322369','2025-10-07 13:18:46.248997','2025-10-07 13:18:46.248997','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning UVE Player app should be hosted','c528f8f7-cfd1-4c23-9669-00f80ed79900'),('57c70e0c-2ffb-4671-8883-cb89d5ffbee6','2026-06-16 10:44:02.280306','2026-06-16 10:44:02.280308','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Webm stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_direct_webm inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','aec65271-5a31-4acc-8787-9fa035ff2f09'),('57dcb4c4-90cc-44a3-aa34-9d433b6502b8','2025-10-07 13:25:14.206889','2025-10-07 13:25:14.206889','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','68aceb09-61a0-4093-9bad-be4f7e379663'),('57e3fcd5-60b2-40ac-bb9d-75b9e6e19c31','2026-04-24 12:29:38.507580','2026-04-24 12:2