 state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','3ae002ff-3cf8-42e9-bcec-60177c1ac869'),('583bf06c-fb41-4245-9b70-39d34d416dce','2026-08-06 05:01:38.576430','2026-08-06 05:01:38.576432','The user should configure PRE_REQ_REBOOT as Yes to reboot the device before test execution, or as No to skip reboot before test execution.','36525c09-f769-414b-a9ee-9c9ea08d3d15'),('5843f46f-f7dc-486d-af5d-21cb64c0cade','2026-06-16 10:44:06.933722','2026-06-16 10:44:06.933724','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an VP9_HDR stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_vp9_hdr inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','204aa8d4-1f5a-4234-bf93-c31bb4f72be0'),('584d0874-4b08-4725-aa06-ac49af28984e','2025-10-07 13:24:15.479186','2025-10-07 13:24:15.479186','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','04ebb6d7-4b79-4bac-be18-e473ee72e102'),('58535d47-018f-4ecf-9378-c47cf47c493d','2025-10-07 13:35:01.318362','2025-10-07 13:35:01.318362','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','f13bf366-8295-460c-9148-bc0da3c863ac'),('58567f46-2a7c-4047-971c-e9058b326c76','2025-10-07 13:35:59.725794','2025-10-07 13:35:59.725794','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','675f081f-fff2-426f-a496-c6694c4d1d4a'),('585dcb48-cdb5-4ad1-99ae-0170036bd9ce','2026-07-30 04:32:17.206959','2026-07-30 04:32:17.206960','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','18fcc222-81ed-4379-982c-9fb4bc431f72'),('585e2b8d-6f63-4054-84c0-109250b290c4','2025-10-07 13:20:55.407667','2025-10-07 13:20:55.407667','1. Either the DUT should be already connected and configured with 5GHz WiFi IP in test manager or a 5GHz WiFi Access point with same IP range is required.\n2. Lightning application for ip change detection should be already hosted.\n3. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n4.If DUT is RPI, then RPI 3B+ is needed to detect  5GHz SSID.','d5ac51e9-5945-4733-8bba-28ed500fd417'),('586137e6-53d6-4876-ad66-7e77e6830c77','2026-03-04 11:18:10.622098','2026-03-04 11:18:10.622099','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','c1a677c2-b101-4b2d-ac50-3d42751cbef7'),('5869a3f1-c0b2-4cc7-9cd5-efdef5423857','2025-10-07 13:29:48.946330','2025-10-07 13:29:48.946330','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.WAN Manager should be enabled\n4.Both DSL WAN and WANOE WAN connections should be available','081be2e2-1846-43d3-861f-1563f148ecb8'),('586d9079-011b-46bb-bd27-3e6a49ee688d','2026-08-06 05:08:55.829340','2026-08-06 05:08:55.829342','Plugins must be in activated state','01de91b3-3b28-4928-ad35-4f6f3d3a4126'),('586df590-56c3-4de1-9c62-ebe046e1c030','2025-10-07 13:45:08.816687','2025-10-07 13:45:08.816687','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it throu