97385','2026-06-16 10:44:11.197387','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a stream with HEVC video codec should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_hevc inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the playback should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_SEEK_POSITION configuration should be set to duration in seconds to which the seek operation should be carried out','cc0bf7d1-e550-4610-9a00-83e936a7cb66'),('5f0203b6-fd58-429d-8298-b2edd431c810','2025-10-07 13:30:24.476222','2025-10-07 13:30:24.476222','If SAT token is to be used, token should be created and made available in test manager. Also the config variables SAT_REQUIRED, SAT_TOKEN_FILE, SERVER_URI should be updated in webpaVariables.py','cd16354b-a5e6-42e1-9731-cc61b3e2e2ec'),('5f02fd8a-c63f-426a-b13a-64ea41c4679f','2025-10-07 13:32:48.039799','2025-10-07 13:32:48.039799','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','0ffb6ef6-517b-4542-83e3-9ed55eaa0ba7'),('5f05c837-d516-4575-820a-aa803d1e8ede','2026-06-04 09:28:25.283689','2026-06-04 09:28:25.283691','TDK Agent should be in a running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.','cfe52416-fbfd-4819-b3da-fc9a8f613540'),('5f07959e-171f-4de8-9730-986174b3b1c3','2025-10-07 13:27:45.662054','2025-10-07 13:27:45.662054','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script<','376530c5-6389-43f9-9a3d-ac90fb8f44a8'),('5f0adb1c-d530-41c8-bd32-9f4f5f8e5a9e','2026-07-01 07:05:24.118330','2026-07-01 