state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','3bd21147-4c65-451a-bdcc-154ed0af81ed'),('5f5387db-4613-4b1d-86fa-bf6202f20fd6','2026-08-06 04:32:42.983190','2026-08-06 04:32:42.983191','The user should configure PRE_REQ_REBOOT as Yes to reboot the device before test execution, or as No to skip reboot before test execution.','60a5655f-0d0e-4fcd-be99-21b5092171f4'),('5f559b11-e72a-4da0-9c65-bd3b85a41c07','2025-10-07 13:28:24.162637','2025-10-07 13:28:24.162637','TDK test agent should be running\nMoCAHAL module\'s parameter xml should be available','b5ee653d-3e86-4eb9-97bb-5ef7d01e49ea'),('5f56846d-ec0a-48ee-a64d-11030dbeb917','2026-06-16 10:44:08.406893','2026-06-16 10:44:08.406896','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests_trickplay application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a H264_24Fps stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264_24fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the slowMotion operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','08c2946b-d99f-43be-8440-8eb252a4b02e'),('5f685f4a-e2c8-434c-8b02-6b264de58d97','2026-08-06 04:25:44.122462','2026-08-06 04:25:44.122463','The following plugins must be available and activatable on the device: org.rdk.DownloadManager, org.rdk.AppPackageManager, org.rdk.AppManager, and org.rdk.RDKWindowManager