ough StartTdk.sh script','6f3f57c2-309b-41cd-9c74-62bdc6cf2c3f'),('98dbb23f-676b-40b3-b5c8-5c1cd199d377','2025-10-07 13:33:25.485809','2025-10-07 13:33:25.485809','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','d2c1cdba-2650-467f-918e-67a220001f9e'),('98df7e05-bfff-49ea-b991-f36b0e63715c','2025-11-03 11:00:18.974698','2025-11-03 11:00:18.974705','TDK Agent should be in a running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.','eb4e8368-20d3-4a80-9b88-3d671f5b2bb2'),('98e1d02f-fe8a-43ae-b133-1bf68ed8ec95','2025-10-07 13:11:12.871214','2025-10-07 13:11:12.871214','None','6d50f7a9-9ded-4050-ab23-bcb0d26127e1'),('98fa56bd-a55b-4515-bd5c-f1825cc6fd5c','2026-06-16 10:44:05.018957','2026-06-16 10:44:05.018959','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a HLS stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_hls inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which each play, pause operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_STRESS_REPEAT_COUNT configuration should be set to the number of times, the operations should be repeated','9bd24edc-fb92-46e4-9af9-e6281906d5b3'),('99032cb7-48c1-4485-a51c-6399dbddefde','2026-06-03 08:52:42.638222','2026-06-03 08:52:42.638224','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2. Ensure that the mse_conformance_test_app_url and mse_key_sequence parameters in the MediaValidationVariables file has latest values.','5c7269af-0cfe-4e7c-a31e-88ad640a4255'),('9903b56d-9c4c-49e3-925d-3c6f4e9d370a','2025-10-07 13:25:26.322424','2025-10-07 13:25:26.322424','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a runni