-07-01 06:53:58.375003','2026-07-01 06:53:58.375003','The `PACKAGEMANAGER_FILE_LOCATOR` key must be set in the device configuration file.','c0bbcc23-0743-487f-b7a8-127372fdbeb6'),('99acac60-cdd8-4fa0-8e7a-c510d9d44b62','2026-09-02 12:35:42.472929','2026-09-02 12:35:42.472930','Download the app package when it is not already available â€” If the app is not installed, download the package via org.rdk.DownloadManager.1.download.','fc56f1b9-31d1-493b-ad07-63db55f22410'),('99bf106b-7f74-4a32-bcd2-9082f4b5bf07','2026-06-16 10:44:13.599168','2026-06-16 10:44:13.599170','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a multi track AAC stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_multi_audio_aac inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore.\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file.\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_PLAYBACK_LATENCY_THRESHOLD configuration should be set to some milliseconds to cross verify the latency during playback.\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','bcfd603c-938d-426b-bacd-09c8dd3d49c4'),('99bfd69d-baf8-4abd-9a65-9a6255d95132','2026-09-02 10:55:44.995554','2026-09-02 10:55:44.995555','Configure Large_Validation_File and app_download_url with a reachable large application bundle and its hosting URL.','b43461c4-a119-4748-835e-86fdee46a598'),('99c31029-c0f8-40c0-8329-2a11150abfd7','2025-10-07 13:27:35.872589','2025-10-07 13:27:35.872589','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','5cf5f16c-b6e4-46ba-9e85-a2ab741ae3e2'),('99c71b79-53c8-4a93-b2da-c2ad86bf8700','2025-12-18 12:39:19.887286','2025-12-18 12:39:19.887294','1.Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.HTML Player app should be hosted.\n3.TV shou