inetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a VP9 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_4k_vp9  inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the slowMotion operation should be carried out','407fe710-59c4-4f66-8cd1-52fcb53fcdf8'),('a0556a59-188d-47fc-900b-512aa6878a91','2026-06-16 10:44:11.012642','2026-06-16 10:44:11.012643','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a multi track AAC stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_multi_audio_aac inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore.\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file.\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_PLAYBACK_LATENCY_THRESHOLD configuration should be set to some milliseconds to cross verify the latency during playback.\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','c2e871e4-6d90-4156-a7c8-fd0ddfcde7d3'),('a05c5085-3f9d-4e41-9146-0e75da35436b','2025-10-07 13:45:32.337991','2025-10-07 13:45:32.337991','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','dc254fe4-05c8-4628-886e-22c9cf472281'),('a070b55c-c9e7-41e4-a036-16d9e9f3f543','2025-10-07 13:25:48.583470','2025-10-07 13:25:48.583470','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem 2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a8dcb305-30eb-4646-b1db-f9e32f6c6e8e'),('a072c3fd-1377-465e-85d1-e5542987ca97','2025-10-07 13:33:25.034518','2025-10-07 13:33:25.034518','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Co