hould be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','fd446731-322b-48cf-9b1e-4b2bbc11cb03'),('b377f626-f4e0-4608-94ac-794649d859b2','2025-10-07 13:34:26.996912','2025-10-07 13:34:26.996912','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3. Wifi client to be connected to 5GHz with DUT.','2c451739-107e-431b-84a6-acbbbfdd52a4'),('b379ade1-25fb-4bd6-8381-585f38d1e91c','2025-10-07 13:17:02.991048','2025-10-07 13:17:02.991048','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','96ecb9a9-3e4d-4a59-964f-1d0f496669fc'),('b38344d3-2d7e-4413-805a-8d1e2554cb27','2025-10-07 13:19:26.452941','2025-10-07 13:19:26.452941','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','d657f3ef-3163-4fa9-990d-cb57180c1367'),('b3835645-da63-47db-84dc-1a1cd879f5c7','2026-07-31 10:12:00.697238','2026-07-31 10:12:00.697239','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state.','9b62f2e7-4010-4730-bf4e-749b0cc98b8a'),('b388b868-27b8-4f3d-baf0-1648d37819d7','2025-10-07 13:36:16.538977','2025-10-07 13:36:16.538977','Set proper values in tdk_platform.properties file and   xconfVariables.py','b43cb8d6-1652-4071-bc0c-8ff27dfb5ed8'),('b392a74a-a96e-42f3-88bb-95dcb9f2024f','2026-07-29 06:28:22.781685','2026-07-29 06:28:22.781687','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.','c48e161a-0450-468e-81f4-8f3092730c7c'),('b3954196-3826-4250-97f3-f0edfbe9e4d4','2026-06-16 10:44:01.328359','2026-06-16 10:44:01.328361','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Webm stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_direct_webm inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','84f98f5b-0b26-4f5e-8531-37c272be4ea8'),('b3970241-ca93-4760-a7cd-83d337b1b5a8','2026-01-07 05:53:26.025558','2026-01-07 05:53:26.025559','Lightning Player app should be hosted','2110513c-080e-4614-8a97-48300492c67f'),('b3a3c9d0-2ef1-497a-b42c-236912514e66','2025-12-03 02:35:13.850135','2025-12-03 02:35:13.850135','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','041c3d49-ac24-4c83-bffa-00914cab4f39'),('b3b6553c-2990-45a5-a169-f37b07d6f1cb','2025-10-07 13:25:11.139942','2025-10-07 13:25:11.139942','TDK Agent should be in running state.','aecf76d9-5d90-4e82-9119-7ad4777cd25f'),('b3c14272-440a-4d71-87d4-fbf78ccaca71','2025-11-15 11:18:54.570413','2025-11-15 11:18:54.570414','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker','e7533105-c50a-44ed-bb6b-7c5655c13bfa'),('b3cd284b-35d5-4c77-b451-ede97cf6588a','2025-10-07 13:30:18.885786','2025-10-07 13:30:18.885786','If SAT token is to be used, token should be created and made available in