2026-07-30 08:28:08.574000','2026-07-30 08:28:08.574001','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','8dafdc66-9028-4602-bae0-b60f7072e55b'),('bccc23dc-63da-4d2e-82ab-7fdc1d329e74','2026-06-16 10:44:04.659009','2026-06-16 10:44:04.659012','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Appsrc_Audio_Underflow_Signal_AV1 stream should be updated in the config variable audio_src_url_mkv inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio pts\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','6b7a34a0-5548-47fd-af93-a83cd3b468ff'),('bcd38d67-c7cc-473a-9e33-9cab3f131cb4','2025-10-07 13:44:48.631187','2025-10-07 13:44:48.631187','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','b63ae9af-660e-4904-b3ed-beb5afa44a00'),('bcd8be13-c113-4404-97c0-2044041d3ae6','2025-10-07 13:24:54.781816','2025-10-07 13:24:54.781816','1. Device should be in ethwan mode\n2. Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n3.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a6d3a0d1-6725-424b-8192-9b85ba3f0cf8'),('bce0affa-48c7-42c4-abf7-1c839b808593','2025-10-07 13:30:00.274146','2025-10-07 13:30:00.274146','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Wan Manager should be enabled\n4.DSL connection must be enabled','8a3b3261-3fa4-4dc9-852f-45ecc7b08d20')