e config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VIDEO_END_POINT configuration should be set to notify the point where video underrun happens ','13129b27-f121-4c01-b5aa-a17a0f74cd17'),('c292c5fc-97c6-4818-9a56-75ef12c368af','2026-07-29 06:43:45.240787','2026-07-29 06:43:45.240789','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a7b5b6b8-1b94-478d-b4ff-dfcd3c43c433'),('c2a00a48-94f0-4a5d-a76f-74963b9672f4','2025-10-07 13:24:59.326332','2025-10-07 13:24:59.326332','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','6e6886af-f70e-4cba-8b85-ce96b320d0cf'),('c2b07ddb-2bac-441a-9a8c-a3f64d7af17a','2026-03-04 06:12:28.610907','2026-03-04 06:12:28.610909','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3. User should configure the LAN client connected port in the device configuration file','878abfca-3cd5-436e-a61c-53642a24a782'),('c2b18bf0-65ad-42d2-9f64-dbc56924e0ce','2025-10-07 13:45:42.644794','2025-10-07 13:45:42.644794','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','111c193d-c362-4de2-9cd7-8e0be79fba31'),('c2b51041-55d5-42cb-96ac-bca6a597707c','2025-10-07 13:17:59.629111','2025-10-07 13:17:59.629111','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','b625cb61-7576-4d0c-9027-28a197de5b37'),('c2b6e05d-af87-4b36-9a8c-fb3ed66cdf76','2025-11-03 09:52:00.922198','2025-11-03 09:52:00.922210','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem','71dfd382-65c0-41cd-b929-ee68088edca2'),('c2b7088f-c1bd-4a8f-ba7b-f880a8c42773','2025-10-07 13:33:07.714509','2025-10-07 13:33:07.714509','1.Ccsp Compone