l the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','34995294-1239-4349-ae7b-37c95b3abd99'),('da755a27-c70c-4a09-9339-f99c99d3b1bc','2026-03-19 06:39:40.328793','2026-03-19 06:39:40.328794','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','8f5e02ee-57e5-4890-831b-d788a033d194'),('da7b33cb-81ec-4edf-a3a7-51d2a3d1494b','2026-06-18 07:00:06.688466','2026-06-18 07:00:06.688474','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an H264 MOV stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_h264_mov inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','74b56ab4-87a0-410d-861f-59605a231f7d'),('da7ec75d-5af7-44b1-8661-34930fe9539f','2026-06-16 10:44:00.070808','2026-06-16 10:44:00.070811','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a stream with  29Fps H264 video codec should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264_29fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the playback should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_SEEK_POSITION configuration should be set to duration in seconds to which the seek operation should be carried out','a0ee1ac7-31b9-4530-9321-f1e3ac1d50f7'),('da872f52-d374-4f9f-bb71-22fda564ae06','2025-10-07 13:33:59.009028','2025-10-07 13:33:59.009028','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','8b278976-8f0c-4747-af7d-8b11cbff73e0'),('da8ac3a8-3941-4d29-b44f-e50ae7ae8aa3','2026-09-02 10:00:50.219528','2026-09-02 10:00:50.219528','Tr069PA should be enabled.','05ef8d42-fea3-42c5-b644-9b755d76cf29'),('da8ca124-35f4-4a57-b703-769b9d6a171d','2025-10-07 13:24:28.622224','2025-10-07 13:24:28.622224','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n','e3bcc32b-e1bf-477c-932c-af1be1a68f2d'),('da8cc5d0-f83a-4050-84a4-c69c7ebe06ce','2025-10-07 13:35:11.459252','2025-10-07 13:35:11.459252','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','803c0a03-4243-4475-9451-19486067361a'),('da9792b0-bbfb-478a-a2b1-b8c0a8bcd271','2025-12-02 08:22:55.618716','2025-12-02 08:22:55.618717','Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device','57331aa5-9be1-4e02-a4f2-2684a00109b5'),('da98f191-69b1-4a05-a561-4d3c7be6d380','2025-12-01 07:50:20.417320','2025-12-01 07:50:20.417326','TDK Agent should be in a running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.','79ad16fa-8453-42ac-b123-e1811fd90d0e'),('da9a0d8f-c07d-4303-891b-7084bf47fb24','2025-10-07 13:16:51.839567','2025-10-07 13:16:51.839567','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','f5d99e17-5ff0-4d5f-b126-877d2235f778'),('da9b5b10-a484-430f-96ac-a8cb3b60e525','2026-06-16 10:44:06.484801','2026-06-16 10:44:06.484803','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Appsrc_Video_Underflow_Signal_AV1 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_mp4_720p_av1 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames','1a200163-8da9-45cf-8b70-e1293aae757e'),('daa442fe-259b-4b1c-bebe-1d131ee1cc78','2026-06-16 10:44:12.244264','2026-06-16 10:44:12.244265','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a 29Fps H264 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264_29fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_SEEK_POSITION configuration should be set to duration in seconds to which the seek operation should be carried out','e99d211f-dc14-4a8b-b2d6-4eb54479dd06'),('daa4b70e-868d-4b38-827d-4eed98747750','2026-07-29 05:31:03.917090','2026-07-29 05:31:03.917091','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state','08ac049c-c478-497b-9456-513dfe010042'),('daa86f61-d06b-4f8a-a75c-16861ed43e14','2025-10-07 13:35:47.022992','2025-10-07 13:35:47.022992','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','79eb6bf9-d356-4816-a3f5-3318b1bfa2d9'),('dac054b0-0026-4b99-83c4-3ddf5c806c10','2025-10-07 13:13:21.569953','2025-10-07 13:13:21.569953','The device must be online