20a773b3077','2026-03-04 11:47:19.489010','2026-03-04 11:47:19.489010','launch_and_load_max_count variable should be configured within StabilityTestVariables.py','1ea59ae1-8e09-402e-b8b3-f851cf3024fa'),('dd11d69b-e253-4e4a-ad60-4cd409b90b5b','2025-10-07 13:44:50.213659','2025-10-07 13:44:50.213659','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','c7569d87-5be1-4c3c-b57c-e0f42464d34c'),('dd20dfeb-c6d4-4532-a054-5237ffeeff31','2026-06-16 10:44:13.625441','2026-06-16 10:44:13.625443','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an MP4 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_mp4 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','39522913-cbde-4835-8647-029581b94f66'),('dd2562e5-3370-4bb9-9034-f3c743f93ec5','2025-11-15 11:16:58.672617','2025-11-15 11:16:58.672620','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','82cac1d0-0042-4f2f-a18e-c3bac97cd567'),('dd3c2dfa-f44c-4c01-a035-45ae3282df49','2025-11-10 07:49:35.301840','2025-11-10 07:49:35.301840','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.HTML Player app should be hosted','20624a5d-a1d6-4d64-a487-0daad8e7bb3f'),('dd3d2b9b-c935-4e33-a043-43cca6c2393a','2026-08-06 04:32:42.983890','2026-08-06 04:32:42.983890','app_download_url must be set to the base URL where the application bundle is hosted. The full download URL is constructed as app_download_url + \"/\" + google_bundle.','60a5655f-0d0e-4fcd-be99-21b5092171f4'),('dd3eafe2-3df0-42b6-ae8b-1cdab7713ba1','2025-10-07 13:33:16.766131','2025-10-07 13:33:16.766131','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b191d788-5d4c-452e-93b4-4e9c3b562534'),('dd45ff85-7ce8-4052-8702-60934aa1564b','2026-07-01 07:12:44.947405','2026-07-01 07:12:44.947406','wpeframework should be running\n','ef44f409-7f6b-4c52-92ee-a31f420a5bda'),('dd4b3fb0-a897-4c79-ae1a-b2b3e4dfaab5','2025-10-07 13:33:08.117597','2025-10-07 13:33:08.117597','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b37482c1-634f-4c14-bfbe-5009ee8a11a6'),('dd504fe1-37da-4654-b739-d0e87ca96658','2026-06-18 07:00:06.087315','2026-06-18 07:00:06.087324','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Dolby stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dolby inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','f2df2a2f-3de6-4857-9d50-1e5decdf4e8d'),('dd563bef-4355-4232-b8f4-6598f0651199','2025-10-07 13:33:14.070526','2025-10-07 13:33:14.070526','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running 