onent\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','819faa41-51d6-4120-9bc9-58b526ca4c6f'),('de4aa380-aea7-4555-8b8f-986826d1afbd','2026-07-29 07:25:12.630067','2026-07-29 07:25:12.630068','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','563cda07-e433-4459-a59d-365ef02d49c3'),('de52e885-d132-4e7d-8042-a46478ceff51','2026-03-19 06:39:37.275385','2026-03-19 06:39:37.275386','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b08ea32f-380d-4a7e-bf2d-5511924f6f79'),('de586500-e36d-47d4-8b45-caadc481b841','2025-10-07 13:36:40.818379','2025-10-07 13:36:40.818379','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','02c1a89f-e48b-4435-b485-e3f4db8ceddd'),('de6be478-3538-4623-8d39-29245b85458b','2025-12-03 02:35:12.902859','2025-12-03 02:35:12.902859','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','301719b0-b247-49b8-b1fe-abceee7720a5'),('de7c6640-5a52-40f0-a818-392c187a615e','2026-06-16 10:44:11.082775','2026-06-16 10:44:11.082777','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a HLS stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_hls inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the rewind operation should be carried out','1dc6ed51-1015-4e5e-a6da-5ad43d766f4e'),('de7d1971-79b6-4144-8368-b11f53f6355f','2025-10-07 13:18:27.770779','2025-10-07 13:18:27.770779','1.Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Shaka Player app should be hosted','434a62bf-93b3-4be4-bc55-157a48db2758'),('de7e60ae-625c-4f6d-922c-a44988ca8128','2026-06-16 10:44:09.094010','2026-06-16 10:44:09.094012','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a EAC3 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_ec3 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the rewind operation should be carried out','76f0ca15-aa20-4e09-a528-1b5e4654b61b'),('de7fe28f-72b7-46f5-9c67-11c2fcf37ff1','2025-12-22 08:26:45.933138','2025-12-22 08:26:45.933139','Lightning Shaka Player app should be hosted','071ee3db-d557-411e-aa06-c857dcd0786d');
