 Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','52438e50-6322-4407-baa8-57234d4c13aa'),('e3e20ef8-9279-4cf8-8974-9e3d880d838a','2026-06-16 10:44:11.168541','2026-06-16 10:44:11.168543','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an Appsrc_Video_Underflow_Signal_H264 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_mp4_30fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n6. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames','4a911250-a191-46c9-8240-ecc48349c290'),('e3e2ffbf-1ecb-4fad-8cbd-22cb0bd0f933','2025-10-07 13:33:33.494663','2025-10-07 13:33:33.494663','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','77600f6a-bdc3-4d09-b6ea-55612c95c325'),('e3e9c9d1-c225-4786-a123-a8d00455e0b2','2025-10-07 13:19:53.259535','2025-10-07 13:19:53.259535','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning UVE AAMP Player app should be hosted','a9fafb77-edbc-4cfa-8267-82ad2a12d04f'),('e3f81f83-d42b-4521-aa26-4a0274b57c1d','2026-06-16 10:44:12.468550','2026-06-16 10:44:12.468552','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an DASH stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as ye