 13:25:36.837039','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','93af0b33-df1f-4e58-bbf3-cf192407f89f'),('eb371411-351a-46d2-8158-440eaf4a6e0a','2025-10-07 13:28:20.970904','2025-10-07 13:28:20.970904','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','2f058aa5-e36c-4d8d-a503-ea56beb3a8eb'),('eb396567-e261-4d1e-b8cd-306e1c2e8daf','2026-09-02 12:15:16.955039','2026-09-02 12:15:16.955040','Configure APPMANAGER_LAUNCH_THRESHOLD_VALUE and THRESHOLD_OFFSET in the applicable device configuration file.','4da0f3cd-9f93-4105-8ba8-e1e0c6170691'),('eb3da730-7605-43b5-bd67-517bd1dc35e7','2026-06-16 10:44:02.506892','2026-06-16 10:44:02.506894','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for a stream with audio underrun should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_audio_underflow inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback\n5. NATIVE_PLAYBACK_AUDIO_END_POINT configuration should be set to notify the point where audio underrun happens ','e611902b-a5ae-42d4-bedd-df490c637f25'),('eb497963-24ef-444d-81b4-63941c2cbcc3','2026-09-02 12:01:39.622343','2026-09-02 12:01:39.622344','Configure PACKAGEMANAGER_FILE_LOCATOR in the applicable device configuration file so a downloaded bundle can be installed.','d03d0a9b-97da-48e3-8c0a-4eec1ee7abee'),('eb52a164-9f92-4566-8bf1-c26e0c3bfe83','2026-02-05 05:14:17.517992','2026-02-05 05:14:17.517993','Lightning Player app should be hosted','4a0